{"id":"d7c35c9db4abaffc","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-subobject-classifier-compat.md","title":"subobject-classifier — Compatibility alias","display":"subobject-classifier — Compatibility alias","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-subobject-classifier-compat","aliases":["16-df-subobject-classifier-compat","16-subobject-classifier"],"display":"subobject-classifier — Compatibility alias","depends_on":["[[16-df-subobject-classifier]]"],"revision_date":"2026-10-20"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-subobject-classifier-compat"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-subobject-classifier-compat</span><span>16-subobject-classifier</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"subobject-classifier — Compatibility alias"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"55e78399bad5fbe9\" href=\"?note=55e78399bad5fbe9\" title=\"16-df-subobject-classifier\">16-df-subobject-classifier</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-20"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 为具有指定终对象 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> 与拉回的范畴；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E\">\\(\\Omega\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{true}:1\\to\\Omega\">\\(\\mathsf{true}:1\\to\\Omega\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\Omega,\\mathsf{true})\">\\((\\Omega,\\mathsf{true})\\)</span> 满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"55e78399bad5fbe9\" href=\"?note=55e78399bad5fbe9\" title=\"16-df-subobject-classifier\">16-df-subobject-classifier</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SubObjCl}_{\\mathcal E}(\\Omega,\\mathsf{true})\">\\(\\mathrm{SubObjCl}_{\\mathcal E}(\\Omega,\\mathsf{true})\\)</span>；其legacy拼写如下定义。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{legacy}\">\\(\\mathrm{legacy}\\)</span> 为下文兼容对象标识的固定标签，不是额外数学结构。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}subobject\\text{-}classifier\\text{-}legacy}\\vdash\n(\\Omega,\\mathsf{true})^{\\mathrm{legacy}}\\coloneqq(\\Omega,\\mathsf{true}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}subobject\\text{-}classifier\\text{-}legacy}\\vdash\n(\\Omega,\\mathsf{true})^{\\mathrm{legacy}}\\coloneqq(\\Omega,\\mathsf{true}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>对每个单态射存在唯一特征态射的拉回泛性质见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"55e78399bad5fbe9\" href=\"?note=55e78399bad5fbe9\" title=\"16-df-subobject-classifier\">16-df-subobject-classifier</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-subobject-classifier","status":"resolved","id":"55e78399bad5fbe9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-subobject-classifier]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-subobject-classifier","status":"resolved","id":"55e78399bad5fbe9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(\\Omega,\\mathsf{true})$ 满足 [[16-df-subobject-classifier]] 的 $\\mathrm{SubObjCl}_{\\mathcal E}(\\Omega,\\mathsf{true})$；其legacy拼写如下定义。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-subobject-classifier","status":"resolved","id":"55e78399bad5fbe9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"对每个单态射存在唯一特征态射的拉回泛性质见 [[16-df-subobject-classifier]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{true}:1\\to\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"(\\Omega,\\mathsf{true})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SubObjCl}_{\\mathcal E}(\\Omega,\\mathsf{true})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{legacy}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}subobject\\text{-}classifier\\text{-}legacy}\\vdash\n(\\Omega,\\mathsf{true})^{\\mathrm{legacy}}\\coloneqq(\\Omega,\\mathsf{true}).","display":true}],"bytes":1073,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-349","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-subobject-classifier-compat|subobject-classifier — Compatibility alias]]"}],"outgoing":["55e78399bad5fbe9"]}